{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19291","headline":"和窦中丞晚入容江作 · 刘禹锡","name":"和窦中丞晚入容江作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉郡三十六，郁林东南遥。\n人伦选清臣，天外颁诏条。\n桂水步秋浪，火山凌雾朝。\n分圻辨风物，入境闻讴谣。\n莎岸见长亭，烟林隔丽谯。\n日落舟益驶，川平旗自飘。\n珠浦远明灭，金沙晴动摇。\n一吟道中作，离思悬层霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}